With $vb(e_1) times vb(e_2) = vb(e_3)$ cyclically, for $vb(a) = vecrow(a_1, a_2, a_3)$ and $vb(b) = vecrow(b_1, b_2, b_3)$:
$ vb(a) times vb(b) = &(a_2 b_3 - a_3 b_2) vb(e_1) \
                      &+ (a_3 b_1 - a_2 b_3) vb(e_2) \
                      &+ (a_1 b_2 - a_2 b_1) vb(e_3). $
Equivalently, this is the formal determinant
$ vb(a) times vb(b) = mdet(vu(i), vu(j), vu(k); a_1, a_2, a_3; b_1, b_2, b_3). $
